<p>Some chains had only a Pyth Core contract that wasn&#x27;t upgraded, so they no longer have a supported contract. <a href="/pro/no-longer-supported">Chains No Longer Supported</a> lists them with their old addresses.</p></div><div class="mt-auto"><nav aria-label="Previous and next pages" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><a class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-xl border border-fd-border bg-fd-card p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-fd-accent" rel="prev" href="/pro/derive-cross-rate"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-body font-medium text-fd-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M165.66,202.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32l-80-80a8,8,0,0,1,0-11.32l80-80a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L91.31,128Z"></path></svg>Derive Cross Rates</span><span class="text-small text-fd-muted-foreground">Learn how to derive synthetic cross rates from two price feeds</span></a><a class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-xl border border-fd-border bg-fd-card p-4 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-fd-accent items-end text-right sm:col-start-2" rel="next" href="/pro/on-chain-fees"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-body font-medium text-fd-foreground">On-chain Fees<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-small text-fd-muted-foreground">On-chain verification fees for Pyth contracts</span></a></nav></div></div><aside class="max-xl:hidden"><div class="sticky top-[calc(var(--preview-header-height)+1.5rem)] flex max-h-[calc(100dvh-var(--preview-header-height)-3rem)] flex-col"><nav aria-label="On this page" class="flex min-h-0 flex-col"><p class="m-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-small text-fd-muted-foreground"><svg x